    {
      "text": "音乐进入高潮时武器同步爆发，在曲目节奏中轰穿成群敌机",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Blast away to the music, taking on hordes of enemy fighters. Tear through their ranks with devastating efficiency as the music power peaks and your weapons flare!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1493520/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "把个人音乐收藏或音乐口味映射成一整片可探索的音乐银河",
      "dimension": "题材",
      "excerpt": "Now, with Beat Hazard 3, you can map your music collection or tastes to a huge explorable galaxy of music.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1493520/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "新Fold能力既可闪避弹幕，也能把武器聚焦成高强度毁灭光束",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Introducing a new 'fold' ability used to dodge enemy fire and focus your weapons into a tight beam of destruction.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1493520/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
